<div class="flow-arrow">&darr;</div>
<div class="flow-step">7 &times; 7 weeks = <em>t&rsquo;shuvah</em> upon <em>t&rsquo;shuvah</em> = purification of the &ldquo;bloods&rdquo;</div>
